from what I usually say.

276
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,258
 Girls' dorm!

277
00:13:50,406 --> 00:13:55,242
 Good evening!

278
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:10,000
I'm sure you know, but
this place is actually for men.

279
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,000
 Only Ryo-tsu-senpai is special.

280
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,000
 I'm impressed.

281
00:14:18,156 --> 00:14:20,156
 This is great.

282
00:14:22,266 --> 00:14:23,266
 Naoko.

283
00:14:25,837 --> 00:14:28,843
 Ryo-tsu-senpai, the moon is beautiful.

284
00:14:28,868 --> 00:14:29,915
 Let's go see it.

285
00:14:30,477 --> 00:14:32,740
 It was cloudy earlier.

286
00:14:32,765 --> 00:14:34,765
 It's okay.

287
00:14:36,269 --> 00:14:37,542
Okay, now.
Roger.

288
00:14:37,937 --> 00:14:38,937
 Roger.

289
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,000
 Oh!

290
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:49,605
 Isn't this an imaginary masterpiece?

291
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,000
 What's that?

292
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,000
 That's a log house kit.

293
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:02,737
It's got all the log materials, so
you can just put them together.

294
00:15:02,839 --> 00:15:04,511
 The gas and the water are also one-touch.

295
00:15:04,536 --> 00:15:08,362
If you build it in the garden,
it'll be everyone's favorite place.

296
00:15:08,456 --> 00:15:11,197
 But there's no log builder.

297
00:15:11,222 --> 00:15:14,220
 We can't build that.

298
00:15:14,245 --> 00:15:18,000
 Isn't there a strong and talented man?

299
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,252
 No, no.

300
00:15:19,277 --> 00:15:22,119
 Men these days are all satisfied.

301
00:15:22,144 --> 00:15:26,000
A man who works with sweat
on his forehead is wonderful.

302
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,000
 That's right.

303
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:30,000
The recent trend is a
man who smells like sweat.

304
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:35,000
I don't know if it's a trend or something,
but have you forgotten someone?

305
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,267
 Oh, what is it?

306
00:15:36,292 --> 00:15:40,000
It's a man who's strong,
talented, and reliable.

307
00:15:41,581 --> 00:15:42,326
 Eh?

308
00:15:42,351 --> 00:15:43,472
 Who are you talking about?

309
00:15:45,456 --> 00:15:46,127
 Eh?

310
00:15:46,152 --> 00:15:48,667
 Are you talking about Ryo-tsu-senpai?

311
00:15:48,730 --> 00:15:52,000
 No, I can't ask Ryo-tsu-senpai to do that.

312
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,000
 Why not?

313
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:57,909
Because Ryo-tsu-senpai
has already decided on a suit.

314
00:15:57,934 --> 00:15:58,934
 Right?

315
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,000
 This is not my true form.

316
00:16:05,727 --> 00:16:08,306
 This is my true form.

317
00:16:10,265 --> 00:16:11,265
 Wonderful!

318
00:16:11,445 --> 00:16:13,445
 And this is my army.

319
00:16:13,975 --> 00:16:17,623
- Even though it's such a waste of time.
- I wonder if it's forced.

320
00:16:17,648 --> 00:16:19,615
Shut up!
Don't talk nonsense!

321
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,000
 First of all, basic construction.

322
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,000
 You guys know that, don't you?

323
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,000
 Oh.

324
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,456
 Let's get started.

325
00:16:27,481 --> 00:16:28,817
Oh. Oh!

326
00:16:28,842 --> 00:16:30,000
 Don't be so stingy!

327
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,000
 Hey!

328
00:16:31,025 --> 00:16:33,025
 What's with that face?

329
00:16:33,406 --> 00:16:35,801
 Men aren't that simple.

330
00:16:45,256 --> 00:16:46,256
 Hey!

331
00:16:46,281 --> 00:16:47,281
 Let's get started!

332
00:16:47,998 --> 00:16:49,000
 Eh?

333
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,733
Let those two stand up
and make them feel that way.

334
00:16:52,147 --> 00:16:55,000
Everyone!
It's lunch time!

335
00:16:55,288 --> 00:16:57,944
 This is our homemade lunch.

336
00:16:57,969 --> 00:16:59,131
 The cookies are homemade too.

337
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,000
 Wow.

338
00:17:01,086 --> 00:17:02,250
 It looks delicious.

339
00:17:02,375 --> 00:17:04,429
 Terai-san and Honda-san, thank you.

340
00:17:04,454 --> 00:17:06,204
 Please do your best.

341
00:17:06,243 --> 00:17:08,000
 I'm counting on you.

342
00:17:08,188 --> 00:17:11,000
 Honda-san is more talented than I thought.

343
00:17:11,368 --> 00:17:12,000
 Is that so?

344
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:15,155
 Terai-san's thick arms seem to have power.

345
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:17,891
 No, it's almost all of it.

346
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,654
 You guys go home!

347
00:17:19,679 --> 00:17:20,679
 Eh?

348
00:17:20,704 --> 00:17:22,000
 Oh no.

349
00:17:22,227 --> 00:17:24,790
 But you guys came all the way here.

350
00:17:24,815 --> 00:17:27,000
 It would be better if you guys cooperated.

351
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,169
 This is enough for me alone.

352
00:17:29,194 --> 00:17:30,194
 Come on, let's go home.

353
00:17:30,219 --> 00:17:31,483
 No, no, no.

354
00:17:31,508 --> 00:17:33,282
 It's not done yet.

355
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,189
 It was a bit of a mistake.

356
00:17:47,644 --> 00:17:50,699
 It is impossible to do it alone.

357
00:17:50,870 --> 00:17:52,886
 I can't ask them to do it now.

358
00:17:53,191 --> 00:17:55,269
 He is really slow.

359
00:17:56,253 --> 00:18:00,441
If this is the case, you have to praise
them, praise them, and make them work hard.

360
00:18:00,656 --> 00:18:01,656
 Okay.

361
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:05,409
 Ryoko-san, do your best.

362
00:18:06,533 --> 00:18:08,533
 You look great when you're working.

363
00:18:08,558 --> 00:18:09,608
 You're so cool.

364
00:18:09,633 --> 00:18:10,633
 Is that so?

365
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:14,000
 I'm surprised.

366
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,000
 You're so strong.

367
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,000
 What is this?

368
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,000
 You're so cool.

369
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:21,000
 You're so manly.

370
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,000
 Is that so?

371
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,894
 That was so easy.

372
00:18:26,245 --> 00:18:28,409
 It's easy to handle.

373
00:18:28,659 --> 00:18:31,941
Let's keep doing this
for 24 hours in turn.

374
00:18:38,351 --> 00:18:40,351
 You're so manly.

375
00:18:46,435 --> 00:18:49,435
 Ryotsu-senpai, you're the best!

376
00:18:51,444 --> 00:18:54,624
 Ryotsu-san, you can do it!

377
00:18:57,031 --> 00:18:59,734
 It looks like 1000 yen isn't enough.

378
00:18:59,851 --> 00:19:03,339
 We need to pay for one of these.

379
00:19:05,429 --> 00:19:07,280
 Ryotsu-san, are you okay?

380
00:19:07,305 --> 00:19:08,622
 I'm a bit tired.

381
00:19:10,234 --> 00:19:11,998
 I'll give you a massage.

382
00:19:12,023 --> 00:19:13,023
 I'll do my best.

383
00:19:13,374 --> 00:19:16,000
 Hurry up and build our log house.

384
00:19:16,202 --> 00:19:19,000
 Of course, Tomoe.

385
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,609
 Revival!

386
00:19:20,634 --> 00:19:21,931
 We did it!

387
00:19:22,289 --> 00:19:24,289
 Let's do this!

388
00:19:38,126 --> 00:19:39,213
 Here's your lunch.

389
00:19:39,556 --> 00:19:40,238
 See you.

390
00:19:40,454 --> 00:19:42,102
 You're leaving already?

391
00:19:42,127 --> 00:19:43,266
 I have work to do.

392
00:19:44,056 --> 00:19:46,000
 Another convenience store lunch?

393
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,657
 It used to be a handmade lunch box.

394
00:19:49,782 --> 00:19:54,345
But now it's half-finished and the
level of the lunch box is going down.

395
00:19:57,439 --> 00:19:59,000
 This again?

396
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:02,000
 The bread and butter days are going on.

397
00:20:02,689 --> 00:20:05,125
 No one comes to 1000 yen these days.

398
00:20:05,150 --> 00:20:07,666
 It looks like they're forced to work.

399
00:20:08,595 --> 00:20:11,227
If this continues, you're
going to break your body.

400
00:20:11,252 --> 00:20:17,000
I feel like my seniors are being
controlled by their girlfriends.

401
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:22,457
Nakagawa-kun, I know how you
feel about being taken away by me.

402
00:20:22,482 --> 00:20:24,000
 I know you're jealous.

403
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:26,209
 But don't be ridiculous.

404
00:20:26,349 --> 00:20:29,000
 I don't think I'm too jealous.

405
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:38,798
 But I'm really tired.

406
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,000
 Senpai!

407
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,423
 Ryotsu-senpai!

408
00:20:43,812 --> 00:20:45,251
 Ryotsu-senpai!

409
00:20:45,353 --> 00:20:46,462
 Senpai!

410
00:20:47,251 --> 00:20:49,900
It looks like Ryotsu-senpai
isn't here yet.

411
00:20:49,925 --> 00:20:51,150
 He's so late.

412
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:53,665
 He should be here any minute now.

413
00:20:53,884 --> 00:20:55,975
 When will he finish?

414
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,814
 I'm tired of nagging him.

415
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:03,146
I worked so hard to get
first place in the survey.

416
00:21:03,171 --> 00:21:05,171
 Just a little more.

417
00:21:06,443 --> 00:21:07,443
 I'm sorry.

418
00:21:07,468 --> 00:21:09,069
 It's okay.

419
00:21:11,429 --> 00:21:14,006
 What's wrong? Did I say something?

420
00:21:15,912 --> 00:21:18,000
 It's nothing. It's nothing.

421
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,000
 Don't worry about it.

422
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:22,000
 Just a little more. I'll do my best.

423
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:24,000
 I'm glad he didn't hear me.

424
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,000
 I'm glad he is a real idiot.

425
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,537
   Shh! He can hear you.

426
00:21:35,515 --> 00:21:37,515
 Watch me.

427
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,000
 Amazing!

428
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,000
 It's so pretty!

429
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,000
 It's finally done!

430
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,000
 Our villa!

431
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:53,000
 It's so pretty!

432
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:55,000
 It smells so good!

433
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,000
 It's like a heaven.

434
00:21:58,975 --> 00:22:00,975
 The bath is bigger than I imagined.

435
00:22:01,584 --> 00:22:03,748
 Let's stay here tonight.

436
00:22:03,773 --> 00:22:05,615
 Cheers!

437
00:22:07,499 --> 00:22:12,499
 I'll teach you how to get angry at me.

438
00:22:18,514 --> 00:22:21,514
 It smells so good.

439
00:22:21,539 --> 00:22:24,256
It feels like I'm in a hot
spring in the mountains.

440
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:29,436
I didn't know he could
do such a great log house.

441
00:22:29,732 --> 00:22:33,076
 Yeah, he really did his best.

442
00:22:33,757 --> 00:22:35,330
 I took a look at it again.

443
00:22:36,529 --> 00:22:37,995
 Komachi.

444
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:39,020
 What?

445
00:22:39,045 --> 00:22:41,381
 You fell in love with Ryotsukan.

446
00:22:41,826 --> 00:22:43,826
 I'm not kidding!

447
00:22:43,889 --> 00:22:45,545
 It's so red!

448
00:22:45,570 --> 00:22:46,570
 It's not!

449
00:22:48,662 --> 00:22:51,201
 Everyone, please be quiet.

450
00:22:51,311 --> 00:22:53,279
 The special seat is 5,000 yen.

451
00:22:53,412 --> 00:22:56,850
 The cameraman is 1,000 yen.

452
00:22:57,117 --> 00:22:58,701
 Here we go.

453
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,000
 Attention, you idiots!

454
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,000
 What's going on?

455
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:29,304
Did you see that?
This is what a real man does!

456
00:23:29,329 --> 00:23:31,708
- What are you doing, you idiot?
- It's so dirty!

457
00:23:33,765 --> 00:23:35,961
 The mini-pad is so dirty!

458
00:23:36,789 --> 00:23:38,548
 I don't have a tire.

459
00:23:39,728 --> 00:23:41,213
 I won't forgive you!

460
00:23:42,734 --> 00:23:45,191
 You're still going to get revenge!

461
00:23:45,250 --> 00:23:48,064
I won't forgive you for
bullying a weak woman!!

462
00:23:48,089 --> 00:23:50,720
 You're not weak at all.

463
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:52,000
 Stop it!

464
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:55,299
He's going to be the
number one bully again.

465
00:24:05,730 --> 00:24:07,564
 New Year's Eve at the chief's house?

466
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:09,084
 I didn't hear that!

467
00:24:09,188 --> 00:24:12,000
 Why didn't you call me?

468
00:24:12,105 --> 00:24:13,112
 Chief!

469
00:24:13,294 --> 00:24:15,724
 I'm going there right now!

470
00:24:15,749 --> 00:24:18,302
 Don't forget the New Year's food!

471
00:24:18,501 --> 00:24:21,000
 Next time on New Year's Battle Carta!

472
00:24:21,211 --> 00:24:22,339
 Thank you for watching!

